<title>UK: UBS adds 100 mln marks to 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>UBS adds 100 mln marks to 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p>BORROWER   UBS FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  UBS</p>
<p> AMT   *100 MLN DEM   COUPON     2.50 PCT  MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  93.975    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    92.225    SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FRANKFURT/LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 250 MLN MARK ISSUE ON</p>
<p>		09.MAY. ORIGINAL DEAL LAUNCHED 09.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
<p>Monday, 28 October 1996 10:13:14</p>
